--swift-version 6
--indent 4
--ranges no-space
--trailing-commas never
--header ignore

# Layout choices that the existing sources already make on purpose: short bodies stay on one line,
# wrapped arguments are kept as written, and explicit `self` stays where it is. The rules that
# rewrite semantics (unusedArguments, redundantSelf) are left to the compiler and review.
--disable wrap,wrapArguments,wrapIfStatementBodies,wrapPropertyBodies,wrapFunctionBodies,wrapSwitchCases,wrapMultilineStatementBraces,unusedArguments,redundantSelf,numberFormatting,docComments,andOperator
